    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Strategize, and Adapt in the Ultimate Zombie Apocalypse!</strong><br>Enter a collapsing world teeming with danger, where every decision shapes your survival. Build your deck, face relentless encounters, and customize your challenges in this unique strategy card game. The question is: How long can you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game presents a new challenge, with encounters created from Mission, Zombie, Danger, and Location decks. These decks combine to create diverse scenarios, ensuring that your strategies are tested in every session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices, Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your deck with powerful cards and prepare for the unexpected. Will you focus on combat efficiency, resource management, or defensive strategies? Every decision matters as you navigate the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter Decks:</strong> Mix and match Mission, Zombie, Danger, and Location cards for endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Scenarios:</strong> Tailor your challenges by choosing how the encounter decks are built.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Strategy:</strong> Create a deck that suits your playstyle and adapt it as the threats evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Survival Atmosphere:</strong> Experience the pressure of making critical decisions in a world of constant danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Focus:</strong> A strategy game designed for players who enjoy testing their tactical skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Will You Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless threats, build your path to survival, and forge your legacy in a world on the brink of collapse. Your journey is waiting\u2014if you dare to take the first step.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Strategize, and Adapt in the Ultimate Zombie Apocalypse!</strong><br>Enter a collapsing world teeming with danger, where every decision shapes your survival. Build your deck, face relentless encounters, and customize your challenges in this unique strategy card game. The question is: How long can you survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game presents a new challenge, with encounters created from Mission, Zombie, Danger, and Location decks. These decks combine to create diverse scenarios, ensuring that your strategies are tested in every session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices, Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your deck with powerful cards and prepare for the unexpected. Will you focus on combat efficiency, resource management, or defensive strategies? Every decision matters as you navigate the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounter Decks:</strong> Mix and match Mission, Zombie, Danger, and Location cards for endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Scenarios:</strong> Tailor your challenges by choosing how the encounter decks are built.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Strategy:</strong> Create a deck that suits your playstyle and adapt it as the threats evolve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Survival Atmosphere:</strong> Experience the pressure of making critical decisions in a world of constant danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Focus:</strong> A strategy game designed for players who enjoy testing their tactical skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Will You Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless threats, build your path to survival, and forge your legacy in a world on the brink of collapse. Your journey is waiting\u2014if you dare to take the first step.</p>",
